        <block__pattern />
        <block__inner>

          <block__text>

            <title mods="gold" tag="h2">

              Just the right food
                        </title>
            <divider>

              <block__line />
              <block__img tag="img" src="assets/img/divider-about.png" alt="" width="247" height="24" />
              <block__line />
                        </divider>
            <node tag="p">

              If you’ve been to one of our restaurants, you’ve seen – and tasted – what keeps our customers coming back for more. Perfect materials and freshly baked food, delicious Lambda cakes, muffins, and gourmet coffees make us hard to resist! Stop in today and check us out!
                        </node>
            <block__photos>

              <block__cook tag="img" src="assets/img/about-cook.jpg" alt="Наш шеф-повар" width="219" height="221" />
                        </block__photos>
                    </block__text>
          <block__picture>

            <block__dish tag="img" src="assets/img/about-dish.jpg" alt="Блюдо ресторана Lambda" width="621" height="625" />
                    </block__picture>
                </block__inner>
            </about>
